1","lemma":"맑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맑고","audio":"/audio/b1d0ff8844cbd3263269.mp3"}},{"text":"투명해.","meaning":"透明","explanation":"투명하다：透明；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"투명하다","audio":"/audio/17487ef1f18e3b1a3a8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82937","senseId":"1","lemma":"투명하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"투명해","audio":"/audio/3683e646802404b83ccb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"79eea25f740b5721","term":"진짜","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3","entryId":"71539","definition":"没有假装或虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["진짜"]},{"id":"c8398a865a747883","term":"맑다","zh":"清澈，明澈","audio":"/audio/c8398a865a7478831698.mp3","entryId":"66031","definition":"由于没有掺杂脏乱的成分，十分洁净。","pronunciation":["막따"]},{"id":"17487ef1f18e3b1a","term":"투명하다","zh":"透明","audio":"/audio/17487ef1f18e3b1a3a8a.mp3","entryId":"82937","definition":"水或玻璃等很透亮。","pronunciation":["투명하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0262a22621dd62179ea1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.19,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66308","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":107,"sequenceScore":2.7876,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，真的非常光滑透明。","那个演员的皮肤不是很好吗？","听说裕敏入选国家队了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那个演员的皮肤不是很好吗？","听说裕敏入选国家队了？","嗯，皮肤真的清透。"],"answer":2}]}
